                "reply_count": 313,
                "retweet_count": 17,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Frankie, a father in Colorado Springs, who relies on an ACA insurance plan to cover his family, is facing a $2197 increase to his monthly premiums.\n\nAfter his wife lost her job earlier this year, Frankie and his family are now grappling with the possibility of losing their coverage entirely next year.\n\nCountless families across Colorado are now facing the same reality due to Republicans\u2019 inaction in the face of expiring premium tax credits that made their insurance affordable.\n\nI won\u2019t give up on extending these credits or fighting for the Coloradans who need them.",
